OL,3,GNEWSAFamily celebrate three generations
OL,4,Ain NHS
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen single mother Dorothy Henry
OL,7,Farrived in the UK from Grenada in the
OL,8,F1950s she started a dynasty - three
OL,9,Fgenerations of women who dedicated
OL,10,Ftheir lives to caring for patients for
OL,11,Fmore than 70 years.
OL,13,FDorothy came to Huddersfield, with her
OL,14,Fyoung daughter, Jacquelin, in about
OL,15,F1959, to begin work at a care home.
OL,17,FTwenty years later Jacquelin joined the
OL,18,FNHS as a trainee nurse and spent her
OL,19,Fentire career working at Huddersfield
OL,20,FRoyal Infirmary.
